      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRIPTOLEMUS (1) led from the get-go and never looked in danger last start in a similar race to this at Moruya. Lightly raced four-year-old building an impressive record. Open to further improvement at the fourth run of the prep and will be very hard to stop. ROCKET RUDEE (2) closed hard to get the cash first-up over 1200m at Narrandera then a few things went wrong in a Rosehill Highway last start so forget that run. Given a freshen up and is back in his right race today. ROONAMI (7) made it three wins from her last five when she cruised to victory over this distance at Bathurst a fortnight ago. Up in grade but going too well to rule out. HELLBERG (5) has won three from four at Corowa and is fitter for two runs back from a spell - right in the mix.",
